---
title: CRC - on-chip, nothing to wire
---
%% ON-CHIP ONLY. The CRC unit has no pins and no external hardware.
%% Fixed CCITT-32 polynomial 0x04C11DB7 in hardware; the driver also offers a
%% software path for other polynomials.
flowchart LR
    subgraph MCU["STM32F429I-DISC1"]
        APP["Application buffer in RAM"]
        DR["CRC_DR - 32-bit data register"]
        ENG["Polynomial engine 0x04C11DB7"]
        OUT["CRC result"]
        SW["Software CRC - other polynomials"]
    end

    APP -->|"word at a time"| DR
    DR --> ENG
    ENG --> OUT
    APP -.-> SW
    SW -.-> OUT
